ParentVault_closeEpoch
├── when caller does not have EPOCH_OPERATOR_ROLE
│   └── it should revert
├── when the vault is paused
│   └── it should revert with EnforcedPause
├── when the expected epoch nonce does not match the current epoch nonce
│   └── it should revert with ParentVault__InvalidEpochNonce
├── when rebalance is in progress
│   └── it should revert with ParentVault__RebalanceInProgress
├── when recovery exists
│   └── it should revert with BaseVault__RecoveryAlreadyPending
├── when epoch is not open
│   └── it should revert with ParentVault__EpochNotOpen
├── when epoch period is too short
│   └── it should revert with ParentVault__EpochTooShort
├── when epoch has no deposits and no withdrawals
│   └── it should revert with ParentVault__EmptyEpoch
├── when TVL is zero and shares are outstanding
│   └── it should revert with ParentVault__ZeroTvlWithOutstandingShares
├── when the scaled TVL-to-share ratio rounds down to zero
│   └── it should revert with ParentVault__ZeroPricePerShare
├── when shares are submitted for burn with zero authoritative shares
│   └── it should revert with ParentVault__ShareBurnWithZeroTotalShares
├── when deposits would settle into too few aggregate shares
│   ├── it should revert with ParentVault__DepositWouldMintZeroShares
│   ├── it should leave the epoch open
│   └── it should allow the depositor to cancel the deposit
├── when previous epoch is not claimable
│   └── it should revert with ParentVault__EpochNotClaimable
├── when TVL is restored by donation
│   └── it should close the current epoch
├── it should store totalWithdrawClaimAmount on the epoch
├── it should initialize remaining claim amounts on the epoch
├── it should update totalShares
├── it should settle deposits and withdrawals with direct full-precision ratios
├── it should make the epoch claimable
├── it should open the next epoch
├── when local strategy has net deposit
│   ├── it should deposit net flow into the adapter
│   ├── it should emit EpochClaimable
│   └── it should emit EpochDepositToStrategySuccess
├── when local strategy has net withdrawal
│   ├── it should withdraw net flow from the adapter
│   ├── it should update totalWithdrawClaimAmount and remainingWithdrawClaimAmount when adapter returns a different amount
│   ├── it should emit EpochClaimable
│   └── it should emit EpochWithdrawFromStrategySuccess
├── when remote strategy has net deposit
│   ├── it should bridge net flow to the strategy chain
│   ├── it should mark the epoch executing
│   ├── when ccipSend reverts
│   │   └── it should revert
│   └── it should emit EpochDepositExecuting
├── when remote strategy has net withdrawal
│   ├── when the remote shortfall is below i_minAssetAmount
│   │   ├── it should make the epoch claimable without an external action
│   │   ├── it should limit the claim pool to Parent-held deposits
│   │   └── it should emit RemoteWithdrawDustForfeited
│   └── when the remote shortfall is at or above i_minAssetAmount
│       ├── it should mark the epoch executing
│       ├── it should request the full remote shortfall
│       └── it should emit EpochWithdrawExecuting
└── when local adapter reverts
    ├── it should revert on net deposit
    └── it should revert on net withdrawal
